    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Test fixture for inference quality tests.</para>
<para>Model discovery follows the same pattern as <ref refid="class_real_embeddings_test" kindref="compound">RealEmbeddingsTest</ref> and <ref refid="class_inference_performance_test" kindref="compound">InferencePerformanceTest</ref>:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>THEMIS_TEST_MODEL_PATH env var</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Filesystem scan for well-known TinyLlama GGUF names</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Every test that requires real inference calls GTEST_SKIP() when<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>THEMIS_ENABLE_LLM is not defined, OR</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No GGUF model is found on the filesystem. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
